00:10:24.150 --> 00:10:25.230
I was going to say, we're back.

281
00:10:25.230 --> 00:10:26.750
We're freezing our butts off.

282
00:10:26.750 --> 00:10:27.870
It's cold in here.

283
00:10:27.910 --> 00:10:32.070
And I just had to wait, like, felt like almost a full 10 minutes for Angela to lay all her

284
00:10:32.070 --> 00:10:32.830
cards on the desk.

285
00:10:32.950 --> 00:10:34.650
It is such a tedious process.

286
00:10:34.990 --> 00:10:37.250
Did you say, lay out all her cards on the desk?

287
00:10:37.410 --> 00:10:39.690
I said, lay out all.

288
00:10:40.030 --> 00:10:40.830
Lay out all.

289
00:10:40.990 --> 00:10:41.630
Lay out all.

290
00:10:41.690 --> 00:10:42.550
Is that St. Louis?

291
00:10:43.350 --> 00:10:49.150
Oh, you're just mad because of Waffle Ball and Chunk It.

